{"messages":[{"content":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `objects` and `places` are nonempty lists of distinct strings. `initial_locations` maps every object to an existing place. `agents` lists `{agent_id:string,initial_beliefs:{object:place_or_null},object_priority:[distinct_existing_objects]}` with distinct agent IDs; initial_beliefs contains every object, null denotes unknown, and explicitly supplied non-null beliefs may already be false. `events` is an ordered list of `{object:existing_object,to:existing_place,observed_by:[distinct_existing_agent_ids]}`. Every event updates the actual location of its object. Exactly the listed observing agents update that object's belief to to; all other beliefs retain their previous value. Process events in order. For each agent, false_belief_objects lists objects with a known belief differing from actual final location; unknown_objects lists objects with null belief. Sort both lists lexicographically. Its stated policy chooses the first object in object_priority with non-null final belief, returning `{type:\"search\",object:object_name,place:believed_place}`; if none exists return `{type:\"abstain\"}`. Return exactly `{actual_locations:final_location_map,agents:[{agent_id,beliefs:final_belief_map,false_belief_objects:[object_names],unknown_objects:[object_names],action:policy_action}]}` with agent rows in input order. Behavior follows these explicit observations and policies. No intentions, emotions, hidden psychological traits, or second-order beliefs are inferred.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"agent_history\",\"objects\":[\"coin\",\"map\",\"vase\"],\"places\":[\"atrium\",\"closet\",\"garden\",\"loft\"],\"initial_locations\":{\"coin\":\"atrium\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"garden\"},\"agents\":[{\"agent_id\":\"Cora\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"coin\":\"atrium\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"garden\"},\"object_priority\":[\"vase\",\"coin\",\"map\"]},{\"agent_id\":\"Dax\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"coin\":null,\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"loft\"},\"object_priority\":[]},{\"agent_id\":\"Eli\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"coin\":null,\"map\":null,\"vase\":null},\"object_priority\":[\"coin\",\"vase\",\"map\"]}],\"events\":[{\"object\":\"coin\",\"to\":\"garden\",\"observed_by\":[]},{\"object\":\"map\",\"to\":\"loft\",\"observed_by\":[]},{\"object\":\"vase\",\"to\":\"atrium\",\"observed_by\":[]},{\"object\":\"coin\",\"to\":\"closet\",\"observed_by\":[]},{\"object\":\"map\",\"to\":\"garden\",\"observed_by\":[]}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"actual_locations\":{\"coin\":\"closet\",\"map\":\"garden\",\"vase\":\"atrium\"},\"agents\":[{\"action\":{\"object\":\"vase\",\"place\":\"garden\",\"type\":\"search\"},\"agent_id\":\"Cora\",\"beliefs\":{\"coin\":\"atrium\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"garden\"},\"false_belief_objects\":[\"coin\",\"map\",\"vase\"],\"unknown_objects\":[]},{\"action\":{\"type\":\"abstain\"},\"agent_id\":\"Dax\",\"beliefs\":{\"coin\":null,\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"loft\"},\"false_belief_objects\":[\"map\",\"vase\"],\"unknown_objects\":[\"coin\"]},{\"action\":{\"type\":\"abstain\"},\"agent_id\":\"Eli\",\"beliefs\":{\"coin\":null,\"map\":null,\"vase\":null},\"false_belief_objects\":[],\"unknown_objects\":[\"coin\",\"map\",\"vase\"]}]}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `objects` and `places` are nonempty lists of distinct strings. `initial_locations` maps every object to an existing place. `agents` lists `{agent_id:string,initial_beliefs:{object:place_or_null},object_priority:[distinct_existing_objects]}` with distinct agent IDs; initial_beliefs contains every object, null denotes unknown, and explicitly supplied non-null beliefs may already be false. `events` is an ordered list of `{object:existing_object,to:existing_place,observed_by:[distinct_existing_agent_ids]}`. Every event updates the actual location of its object. Exactly the listed observing agents update that object's belief to to; all other beliefs retain their previous value. Process events in order. For each agent, false_belief_objects lists objects with a known belief differing from actual final location; unknown_objects lists objects with null belief. Sort both lists lexicographically. Its stated policy chooses the first object in object_priority with non-null final belief, returning `{type:\"search\",object:object_name,place:believed_place}`; if none exists return `{type:\"abstain\"}`. Return exactly `{actual_locations:final_location_map,agents:[{agent_id,beliefs:final_belief_map,false_belief_objects:[object_names],unknown_objects:[object_names],action:policy_action}]}` with agent rows in input order. Behavior follows these explicit observations and policies. No intentions, emotions, hidden psychological traits, or second-order beliefs are inferred.\nTask JSON:\n{\"events\":[{\"observed_by\":[],\"to\":\"garden\",\"object\":\"coin\"},{\"observed_by\":[],\"to\":\"loft\",\"object\":\"map\"},{\"observed_by\":[],\"to\":\"atrium\",\"object\":\"vase\"},{\"observed_by\":[],\"to\":\"closet\",\"object\":\"coin\"},{\"observed_by\":[],\"to\":\"garden\",\"object\":\"map\"}],\"agents\":[{\"object_priority\":[\"vase\",\"coin\",\"map\"],\"initial_beliefs\":{\"vase\":\"garden\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"coin\":\"atrium\"},\"agent_id\":\"Cora\"},{\"object_priority\":[],\"initial_beliefs\":{\"vase\":\"loft\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"coin\":null},\"agent_id\":\"Dax\"},{\"object_priority\":[\"coin\",\"vase\",\"map\"],\"initial_beliefs\":{\"vase\":null,\"map\":null,\"coin\":null},\"agent_id\":\"Eli\"}],\"initial_locations\":{\"vase\":\"garden\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"coin\":\"atrium\"},\"places\":[\"atrium\",\"closet\",\"garden\",\"loft\"],\"objects\":[\"coin\",\"map\",\"vase\"],\"kind\":\"agent_history\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"actual_locations\":{\"coin\":\"closet\",\"map\":\"garden\",\"vase\":\"atrium\"},\"agents\":[{\"action\":{\"object\":\"vase\",\"place\":\"garden\",\"type\":\"search\"},\"agent_id\":\"Cora\",\"beliefs\":{\"coin\":\"atrium\",\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"garden\"},\"false_belief_objects\":[\"coin\",\"map\",\"vase\"],\"unknown_objects\":[]},{\"action\":{\"type\":\"abstain\"},\"agent_id\":\"Dax\",\"beliefs\":{\"coin\":null,\"map\":\"closet\",\"vase\":\"loft\"},\"false_belief_objects\":[\"map\",\"vase\"],\"unknown_objects\":[\"coin\"]},{\"action\":{\"type\":\"abstain\"},\"agent_id\":\"Eli\",\"beliefs\":{\"coin\":null,\"map\":null,\"vase\":null},\"false_belief_objects\":[],\"unknown_objects\":[\"coin\",\"map\",\"vase\"]}]}","role":"assistant"}]}
